>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">Autoimmune hepatitis&nbsp;/ primary biliary cirrhosis&nbsp;/ Sj&ouml;gren syndrome</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">Ascariasis</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">Synchronous malignant tumours</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">IGH::<em>MALT1</em><sup>c</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">Trisomy&nbsp;3</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">Trisomy&nbsp;18</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">Not reported</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.2%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Gallbladder and extrahepatic bile duct</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.14%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&lt;&nbsp;1%</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Gallstones</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cholecystitis</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\"><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">BIRC3</span></em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">::<em>MALT1<sup>c</sup></em></span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Not reported</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Not reported</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.2%; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\"><strong>Pancreas</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.14%; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">&lt;&nbsp;1%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">Unknown</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">Not reported</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">Not reported</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.66%; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210069628;\">Not reported</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&alpha;HCD, alpha heavy chain disease; CNA, copy-number aberrations; IPSID, immunoproliferative small intestinal disease.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>These associated conditions have not all been proved to be pathogenetically significant. <sup>b</sup>Data on recurrent mutations are based on small numbers of gastric EMZL and rare cases of intestinal EMZL. <sup>c</sup>Based on very small series and case reports.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Data are summarized according to Schreuder et al. <span class=\"Ref-ID\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: FR;\">{29225710}</span></span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: FR;\">, Cerhan et al. <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{33829216}</span>, Huang et al. <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{39054516}</span>, Vela et al. <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{34494161}</span>, Steinbrecher <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{39624879}</span>, and Rossi et al. <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{35139275}</span>.</span></p>",
